      DHUN is a multi-source music client by direction. The feature groups below
      describe native Android/desktop code, not a guarantee of live playback or
      browser parity. The separate browser client currently uses JioSaavn, has no
      audio downloads, equaliser or lyric provider, and remains playback-unverified.
      YouTube Music is first priority; Spotify is planned, not implemented.
    </p>
